  "plain": "Roswell is a New Mexico town where, in 1947, many people say a strange craft crashed. A scientist, Dr. John Brandenburg, speaking on Jesse Michels' podcast and drawing on his book Cosmic Awakening, offers a theory: two craft were flying low and close together during a lightning storm, scanning for plutonium, with one picking up the background noise and the other picking up the signal. In his view, this would explain why the craft came to Roswell and why one came down."
